      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems actually not necessary to keep the host EPT lock locked all the time here. If we just call __pkvm_host_share_hyp_prot() (which locks and unlocks it) and then __pkvm_pin_shared_mem() (which also locks and unlocks it) then, the host may indeed maliciously or mistakenly unshare the page during the time window between __pkvm_host_share_hyp_prot() and __pkvm_pin_shared_mem(). But then, __pkvm_pin_shared_mem() will detect that the page state is OWNED instead of SHARED_OWNED, so it will fail, and thus __pkvm_host_donate_hyp_request_ro() will also fail?",
